Rāma revives and sees stricken Lakṣmaṇa --- Rāma cries life and Sītā vain without brother --- Rāma dreads telling mothers and Bharata --- Rāma vows to follow Lakṣmaṇa in death --- Rāma praises peerless loyal Lakṣmaṇa --- Rāma bids Sugrīva retreat across ocean --- Rāma praises monkeys and grants leave --- Vibhīṣaṇa hastens as monkeys mistake him